---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — Nawtch"
  description="Nawtch's Terms of Use — the rules for using our free calorie tracker and fitness calculators, including important notes on medical advice and data responsibility."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  bodyClass="terms"
>
  <header>
    <div class="header-left">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Effective date: August 6, 2026</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ghost-btn" href="#" onclick="window.history.back(); return false;">← Back</a>
  </header>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        Please read these Terms of Use ("Terms") carefully before using Nawtch, available at <a href="https://nawtch.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://nawtch.app</a> (the "Service"). By
        using the Service, you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the Service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">The Service</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        Nawtch is a free, browser-based tool for logging food, calories, macros, cost, weight, and workouts, and
        for using fitness and nutrition calculators. No account is required, and your tracking data is stored
        locally in your browser rather than on any server. For details on how data is (and isn't) handled, see
        our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Not Medical Advice</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        Nawtch's calculators, diet information, and related content — including but not limited to TDEE, BMR,
        BMI, body fat, VO2 max, one-rep max, and similar estimates — are provided for general informational and
        educational purposes only. They are based on published formulas and research, which are cited where
        used, but they are estimates, not personalized medical, nutritional, or fitness advice, and they do not
        account for individual medical conditions, medications, or circumstances.
        <br /><br />
        Always consult a qualified healthcare provider, registered dietitian, or other appropriate professional
        before making decisions about your diet, exercise, or health based on information from the Service —
        particularly if you have any underlying health condition, are pregnant, are under 18, or are
        considering a significant change to your diet or exercise routine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Your Responsibility for Your Data</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        Because your tracking data is stored only in your browser, you are responsible for backing it up (using
        the export feature) if you want to preserve it. Clearing your browser's site data, switching devices or
        browsers, or reinstalling your operating system may permanently delete this data, and Nawtch has no way
        to recover it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Age Requirement</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        The Service is intended for users 13 years of age or older. If you are under 18, you should use the
        Service only with the involvement of a parent or guardian, particularly with respect to any diet or
        exercise decisions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Third-Party Content and Services</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        The Service uses the Open Food Facts database for barcode scanning and food data, and links to external
        sources (such as published research and government health resources) to support the information
        provided. Nawtch does not control and is not responsible for the accuracy, completeness, or
        availability of this third-party content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Advertising</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        The Service is supported by advertising served through Google AdSense. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details on how advertising-related data is handled.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings-section">
    <h2 class="settings-section-title">Intellectual Property</h2>
    <div class="settings-section-body">
      <p class="settings-desc">
        The Nawtch name, logo, and the design, text, and original content of the Service are owned by Nawtch
